  <section id="booking">
    <h2>Booking and value tips</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>If you need five people in one unit, book a studio, not a one-bedroom.</strong> That is the opposite of some other DVC buildings.</li>
      <li><strong>Compare a villa studio with a Beach Club hotel room that also sleeps five,</strong> if you don't need a kitchenette.</li>
      <li><strong>Disney Vacation Club members book with points; cash rates are full rack prices,</strong> tax included, from the 2026 published ranges above.</li>
